.alert.alert-light.border
  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Goal of this page
  %p.mb-3
    Let the employee acknowledge each latest finalized check-in rating (optional notes), so voice is on the employment record. Their own rating already reflects how they saw performance relative to the final.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Context
  = render 'shared/maap/definition'
  = render 'shared/check_ins/three_step_clarity_flow', organization: organization, teammate: @teammate

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Specifics of this page
  %ul.mb-0
    %li Shows only the <strong>latest finalized</strong> position, assignment, and aspirational value check-ins that still need acknowledgement and have at least one real rating.
    %li Per check-in choose <strong>Leave Unacknowledged</strong> (default) or <strong>Acknowledge</strong>; notes are optional.
    %li Use <strong>Acknowledge all</strong> then <strong>Save All</strong> to submit acknowledgements in one pass. Leave Unacknowledged rows are skipped.
    %li Once saved, acknowledgement cannot be changed.
    %li Notes for employee, manager, and Reviewed Together sit in expandable display boxes under each rating. On assignments, employee energy shows under the rating with the check-in date range; Reviewed Together shows going-forward energy under the rating.
    %li This page is Step 3 of the clarity check-in flow. Snapshot history lives on View Audit and no longer drives pending acknowledgement.
